<title>NORWAY: Aker RGI 1996 net result NOK 420 mln.</title>
<headline>Aker RGI 1996 net result NOK 420 mln.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31.</p>
<p>				    (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover				20,409    vs    17,054</p>
<p> Operating result			 421    vs     1,241</p>
<p> Result after financial items	 969    vs     1,313</p>
<p> Net result				 420    vs	 842</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of Norwegian industrial holding company is Aker RGI ASA. The company was established last year after Resource Group International (RGI) merged with engineering and construction group Aker ASA. Comparative 1995 figures were calculated on a pro forma basis.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
